Description: Wild OS Cooler
 Cooler looks after a liquid cooler that has a screen (NZXT Kraken): it
 chooses the face shown on the cooler's screen, sets how fast the pump and
 fans run, and shows the temperatures and speeds as they change. Settings
 are kept on this PC. Nothing is sent anywhere: no accounts and no
 tracking.
